For Debugging API calls within the test we can use "Debug npm script" from the command palatte after adding a breakpoint within the script and adding npm test command to package.json 
Example: "test": "npx playwright test webAPiTest.spec.js"

there is page.on() -  It sets up an event listener that listens for specific browser actions or triggers—like network requests, console logs, or page errors.